stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> PENDING: validated checkout
    PENDING --> ACCEPTED: vendor accepts before expiry
    PENDING --> REJECTED: vendor rejects
    PENDING --> CANCELLED: customer or vendor cancels
    PENDING --> EXPIRED: pending deadline
    ACCEPTED --> PREPARING: vendor starts
    ACCEPTED --> CANCELLED: vendor cancels
    PREPARING --> READY: vendor marks ready
    PREPARING --> CANCELLED: reason and stock disposition
    READY --> COLLECTED: vendor confirms handover
    READY --> CANCELLED: reason and stock disposition
    COLLECTED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
